WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs

01:35.010 --> 01:39.910
Episode 1:
A Sad Birthday

01:59.610 --> 02:03.720
Remy! Nana!
Aren't you up yet?

02:10.010 --> 02:14.120
Sis.. Wake up. Sis!

02:18.010 --> 02:20.270
Hey, Sis!

02:34.510 --> 02:37.440
Remy, what are you doing down there?

02:37.450 --> 02:39.110
Good morning mother.

02:45.110 --> 02:46.520
It's time to get up.

02:48.510 --> 02:51.310
Okay, I'm awake.

02:54.910 --> 02:56.310
Stop it!

03:01.620 --> 03:03.320
Got you!

03:04.890 --> 03:06.720
Stop it, Sis!

03:09.170 --> 03:12.910
Stop it Remy.
Today's your birthday right?

03:15.940 --> 03:18.430
Congratulations, you're ten years old.

03:22.120 --> 03:26.480
My birthday... Today's really my birthday.

03:26.790 --> 03:28.940
And this hat is for me, mother?

03:29.360 --> 03:32.440
Yes, I hope you like it.

03:32.820 --> 03:35.420
Lucky... You're so lucky, Sis.

03:35.430 --> 03:37.420
Take a look in the mirror.

03:38.120 --> 03:38.990
Okay!

03:40.930 --> 03:43.010
It's beautiful!

03:43.430 --> 03:45.660
Thank you, mother!

03:45.940 --> 03:48.170
Lucky! You're so lucky, Sis.

04:00.130 --> 04:01.780
Yes. All done!

04:02.730 --> 04:06.030
Hey, Rousette, do you like my hat?

04:08.310 --> 04:10.310
You like it don't you?

04:10.530 --> 04:12.190
Sis, are you ready?

04:12.430 --> 04:13.510
Yup!

04:13.770 --> 04:16.690
We'll go to Mr. Lacontte's store.

04:17.190 --> 04:18.690
Let's go.

04:22.570 --> 04:23.500
Remy?

04:23.510 --> 04:24.330
Yes?

04:24.560 --> 04:29.910
With the money you get from the milk and butter, buy some flour so I can make stew.

04:30.560 --> 04:31.660
Stew!

04:31.680 --> 04:33.340
To celebrate Remy's birthday.

04:34.140 --> 04:37.420
All right, let's go.
See you later!

04:43.140 --> 04:48.240
If he returned from Paris we would be a perfectly happy family.

04:48.930 --> 04:50.040
Anne!

04:51.270 --> 04:52.940
Alan, Regina, good morning.

04:53.140 --> 04:55.240
Something terrible has happened.

04:55.290 --> 04:58.990
We heard that your husband has suffered a terrible accident in Paris.

04:59.250 --> 05:04.800
A witness said it seemed serious and that he cannot work now.

05:05.630 --> 05:07.880
Anne!
Are you okay?

05:07.900 --> 05:09.000
Ye-yeah.

05:09.850 --> 05:17.950
If you need something, please tell us.
We'll see if we can do something to help.

05:19.650 --> 05:23.260
Can't children participate in the singing competition?

05:23.420 --> 05:25.400
I don't know.

05:25.420 --> 05:27.760
If you could participate you'd definitely win first prize.

05:32.850 --> 05:42.030
Mother, mother, my mother

05:42.050 --> 05:47.340
Your gentle hugs holding me

05:47.460 --> 05:55.760
When I'm lonely and sleeping at night

05:56.210 --> 06:01.210
Her heart is my hometown

06:01.690 --> 06:06.050
My mother

06:06.590 --> 06:12.260
Her heart is my hometown

06:12.310 --> 06:18.020
My mother

06:19.570 --> 06:21.340
We should rest a moment.

06:21.460 --> 06:23.460
Yeah, good idea.

06:28.960 --> 06:34.240
Ah! That's right! I completely forgot!
How can I be so stupid!

06:34.320 --> 06:36.040
What's wrong Sis?

06:36.060 --> 06:38.340
Today is also mother's birthday!

06:39.850 --> 06:40.940
Really?

06:40.950 --> 06:41.670
Yeah.

06:42.070 --> 06:45.600
Mother and me have birthdays on the same day.

06:45.950 --> 06:48.470
Lucky... You're so lucky, Sis.

06:49.070 --> 06:51.470
What should I get her for a present?

06:51.670 --> 06:54.270
I think I gave her flowers last time.

06:54.450 --> 06:56.520
Hmm.. What to get?

06:56.670 --> 06:57.770
What to get?

06:59.070 --> 06:59.860
A dog!

07:15.800 --> 07:17.830
Nana! Let's go!
- Huh?

07:20.680 --> 07:22.080
Good morning!

07:22.120 --> 07:23.890
I really like your hat.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.190
Someone's there.

07:44.930 --> 07:47.570
Sis, let's go.

07:48.670 --> 07:50.490
Come on, Sis!

07:52.170 --> 07:54.030
Sis!

08:09.780 --> 08:14.270
Good morning.
Umm.. Can you do us a favor?

08:17.550 --> 08:22.080
We don't know what present to get our mother for her birthday.

08:22.120 --> 08:23.680
Why ask me?

08:24.960 --> 08:29.890
You've traveled a lot and probably learned some original ideas.

08:30.230 --> 08:32.280
Was that you singing a little while ago?

08:33.960 --> 08:34.830
Yes.

08:40.470 --> 08:42.990
I understand. Time to go.

08:44.230 --> 08:45.670
That dog is smart.

08:46.790 --> 08:49.180
Are you headed for the village?
Want to come along?

08:50.350 --> 08:51.280
Yeah.

08:56.090 --> 08:58.580
Why can't you ask your father?

08:59.860 --> 09:01.320
About the present.

09:03.790 --> 09:06.810
We can't because father's...
- in Paris.

09:07.700 --> 09:08.500
Paris?

09:08.580 --> 09:12.200
He's been working there for a long time.

09:12.220 --> 09:13.780
Since I was a baby.

09:14.000 --> 09:16.360
Sometimes he sends us money.

09:16.400 --> 09:23.280
Every night before bed I always wonder how father's doing.

09:23.880 --> 09:26.030
Sis, do you remember him?

09:26.040 --> 09:29.790
No, because I was very little the last time I saw him.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.600
I bet he's tall.

09:31.700 --> 09:32.600
For sure he is.

09:33.300 --> 09:38.800
He's the nicest man in the world.
I hope he returns soon.

09:47.310 --> 09:49.650
Thanks a lot for bringing us.
- Thank you.

09:49.910 --> 09:53.110
Don't stop thinking about your present.

09:53.210 --> 09:56.660
As long as it's from your heart she'll love it.

09:56.680 --> 09:57.590
Okay.

10:00.510 --> 10:02.610
Goodbye!
- Goodbye!

10:04.210 --> 10:06.470
I wonder what his name was.

10:09.280 --> 10:11.920
Here's the money for the milk and butter.

10:11.950 --> 10:12.770
Thank you.

10:12.800 --> 10:17.710
Everyone likes the butter made from Rousette's milk.

10:17.720 --> 10:19.520
In fact I love it.

10:19.520 --> 10:22.430
Rousette is a wonderful cow that produces a lot of milk.

10:24.620 --> 10:28.420
She supports them until their father comes back.

10:28.430 --> 10:32.500
They sell Rousette's milk and butter for money.

10:32.530 --> 10:37.550
Yeah,  if you have a cow you can live on, no matter how poor you are.

10:37.560 --> 10:44.200
That's why I sing my song to Rousette every day. To help her make good milk.

10:44.280 --> 10:45.460
Me too!

10:45.500 --> 10:47.580
You sing? That's funny.

10:51.800 --> 10:55.360
So, you wanted some flour, right?
- Yes.

10:56.620 --> 10:57.720
I'll leave this here.

10:57.760 --> 10:59.230
Sure, thanks a lot.

10:59.330 --> 11:01.830
It's the prize for the contest.

11:01.830 --> 11:02.830
The singing contest?

11:07.730 --> 11:10.450
This is only for the winner.

11:11.530 --> 11:12.930
Henry, can we see it?

11:12.930 --> 11:14.530
Sure, if you like.

11:19.730 --> 11:25.230
<i>I've never seen such a beautiful dish.
Mother would love it.</i>

11:32.290 --> 11:34.250
My husband got seriously injured.

11:43.430 --> 11:45.640
Huh? You want to participate in the contest?

11:46.030 --> 11:48.630
Yes. Can I participate?

11:48.740 --> 11:52.150
No one says you can't but...

11:52.400 --> 11:56.120
Maybe you're too young to participate.

11:56.220 --> 11:58.660
You should talk to the mayor and hear his opinion.

11:58.920 --> 12:00.780
I'll do that.

12:02.740 --> 12:04.160
Mr. Mayor!

12:05.410 --> 12:07.840
Remy is always full of energy.

12:07.840 --> 12:11.420
If she does participate you'll have no chance to win.

12:11.550 --> 12:14.570
What are you saying?
I'll win for sure!

12:14.610 --> 12:16.640
Thank you so much!

12:18.640 --> 12:21.760
Don't tell mother that I'm going to sing in the competition.

12:22.520 --> 12:24.400
I want mother to be surprised.

12:25.350 --> 12:26.390
Got it.

12:27.500 --> 12:32.400
I want that dish to be mother's birthday present.

12:32.830 --> 12:34.350
Stop, Bruno!

12:36.850 --> 12:39.850
Remy, do you know what happened?

12:40.640 --> 12:43.590
Your father has suffered an accident.

12:43.640 --> 12:45.200
My father has been injured?

12:46.910 --> 12:48.500
Wait, Sis!

13:05.050 --> 13:06.890
Now I really need to win that contest.

13:07.350 --> 13:08.750
For mother's sake.

13:09.860 --> 13:11.660
Nana, will you help me?

13:18.600 --> 13:19.760
That's it!

13:52.470 --> 13:53.960
Good job, Lacontte!

13:54.040 --> 13:55.830
You're going to win!

13:59.310 --> 14:02.760
He sings well doesn't he?
- Absolutely!

14:02.760 --> 14:04.560
Clearly I'll be the winner.

14:04.560 --> 14:06.290
Remy hasn't sung yet.

14:07.500 --> 14:08.700
That again...

14:09.780 --> 14:13.790
Is that girl going to participate or not?

14:15.270 --> 14:16.280
Coming!

14:18.060 --> 14:19.060
What do you want?

14:19.070 --> 14:24.570
My name is Ramon. I've come to pick up the item Jerome promised me.

14:24.670 --> 14:26.800
What did he promise you?

14:27.170 --> 14:32.570
Well, now we have the last participant in this year's contest.

14:32.570 --> 14:34.270
Remy Barberin.

14:39.470 --> 14:43.070
Hello everyone!
I have brought an assistant with me today.

14:43.770 --> 14:45.210
That's funny.

14:50.570 --> 14:51.370
Mayor.

14:54.370 --> 14:55.370
Mother.

14:55.540 --> 14:56.920
What's wrong, Anne?

14:57.550 --> 14:59.420
Mayor, can I talk to you for a moment?

15:05.380 --> 15:08.680
This is a letter to you from your husband.

15:11.280 --> 15:12.680
Can you read it, Mayor?

15:12.730 --> 15:13.680
Of course.

15:13.680 --> 15:18.440
About 6 months ago your husband fell from high up and suffered serious injuries.

15:19.040 --> 15:21.570
Fortunately his life wasn't in danger.

15:21.910 --> 15:26.780
But his hospital charges were very high and I lent him the money to pay them.

15:26.980 --> 15:27.780
You did?

15:28.630 --> 15:30.650
Because I was his friend and live in the town next to this one.

15:30.980 --> 15:33.980
It's true, that's indeed what's written here.

15:34.080 --> 15:37.470
He did not have enough money and promised him your cow for the expenses.

15:37.490 --> 15:39.080
That is what Jerome wants.

15:39.090 --> 15:41.290
Madame, you have to pay me back.

15:48.630 --> 15:50.390
Just a warm up!

15:59.230 --> 16:09.980
Mother, mother, my mother

16:09.990 --> 16:15.590
Your gentle hugs holding me

16:15.640 --> 16:25.690
When I'm lonely and sleeping at night

16:27.500 --> 16:33.190
Her heart is my hometown

16:33.590 --> 16:39.890
My mother

16:42.190 --> 16:52.820
Mother, mother, my mother

16:52.990 --> 16:59.090
I'll wander the land forever

16:59.380 --> 17:09.840
My heart is singing

17:10.400 --> 17:16.300
Her heart is my hometown

17:16.500 --> 17:23.900
My mother

17:30.100 --> 17:31.400
Remy...

17:40.000 --> 17:41.800
The winner is Remy.

17:45.700 --> 17:48.500
I can't waste any more time!
I'm taking the cow now!

17:51.070 --> 17:53.300
Rousette!

17:58.710 --> 18:00.760
Shut up already!

18:01.400 --> 18:03.100
Rousette, where are you going!?

18:03.180 --> 18:05.270
Mother, where is he taking Rousette?

18:10.480 --> 18:11.990
Rousette!

18:21.110 --> 18:22.540
Rousette...

18:23.310 --> 18:25.200
Rousette!

18:54.770 --> 18:57.910
I'm sorry that I couldn't make the stew.

18:59.910 --> 19:05.750
Tomorrow we'll have no milk or money to buy food.

19:05.910 --> 19:09.310
Nana, it's not mother's fault.

19:09.330 --> 19:14.260
But Sis, these dishes are for eating stew.

19:15.310 --> 19:19.090
These dishes can be used for more than just stew.

19:19.810 --> 19:23.510
Look, even bread looks good in them.

19:27.520 --> 19:29.100
You're right.
- See?

19:37.920 --> 19:38.700
Remy...

19:40.900 --> 19:46.460
It's true that life will get harder from now on,

19:47.020 --> 19:49.700
but with the three of us together we'll pull through.

19:49.970 --> 19:52.720
I'll help in any way I can.
- Me too.

19:54.120 --> 19:58.720
Let's pray that father's wounds heal soon.

20:22.920 --> 20:24.160
Sis!

20:26.640 --> 20:28.770
Who are you?
What do you want?

20:29.320 --> 20:30.370
Is it dinner time?

20:32.500 --> 20:33.590
Dear.

20:35.760 --> 20:37.140
We haven't seen you in so long.

20:37.420 --> 20:40.260
How are your wounds?
- Don't touch me.

20:40.530 --> 20:42.230
They still hurt.

20:42.230 --> 20:43.260
Father...

20:44.240 --> 20:45.170
Remy?

20:45.680 --> 20:47.270
You're Remy aren't you?

20:48.570 --> 20:49.270
Yes.

20:49.530 --> 20:51.520
What are you doing here?

20:53.150 --> 20:55.640
What the hell are you doing here!?

20:55.740 --> 20:57.180
Dear! Stop it!
- Shut up!

21:14.040 --> 21:15.840
That's our father...

21:15.840 --> 21:17.440
Sis, I'm scared!

21:18.240 --> 21:20.760
Stop it, today is Remy's birthday.

21:21.140 --> 21:22.970
But it's also your birthday.

21:23.740 --> 21:27.640
Nana is our daughter for sure, but Remy isn't.

21:27.640 --> 21:30.640
Her parents left her in the street.
Clearly, it's not her birthday.

21:31.340 --> 21:37.340
Nobody knows when she was born.
So you made her birthday the same as yours.

21:37.780 --> 21:39.530
We have no money!

21:39.530 --> 21:47.830
Try to love yourself more

21:40.050 --> 21:43.930
How can we feed another mouth!

21:49.250 --> 21:58.750
Abandoned dreams can be seen again

21:58.850 --> 22:07.550
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:08.250 --> 22:19.750
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:19.950 --> 22:29.850
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:30.050 --> 22:39.650
From the future that gives us our fate

22:39.850 --> 22:47.950
Try to seek for them more

22:49.350 --> 22:53.250
Give your heart to

22:53.350 --> 23:08.050
That person who is also seeking you

23:20.310 --> 23:23.250
Mother, was I really a foundling?

23:23.270 --> 23:28.220
The day after that shocking revelation I was told what happened in Paris 10 years ago.

23:28.580 --> 23:32.410
My father found me when I was a baby.

23:32.600 --> 23:36.770
Please look forward to it!

23:32.600 --> 23:36.770
<i>Goodbye Mother</i>

23:32.600 --> 23:36.770
Next time:
